\"id\":\"85fe562\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p style=\\\"font-size: 17.5px; color: #756C66; line-height: 1.6;\\\">Existente eternamente en tres personas co-iguales: Dios Padre, Dios Hijo y Dios Esp\\u00edritu Santo.<\\/p>\",\"paragraph_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":5,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=000b116\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"46e99b1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"20\",\"row\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"20\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_color\":\"#E7E0D8\",\"animation\":\"fadeInUp\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ca2be59\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"5\",\"row\":\"5\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"5\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"39a9654\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"La salvaci\\u00f3n por gracia\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#282320\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=e8d16ad\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"9c21cae\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p style=\\\"font-size: 17.5px; color: #756C66; line-height: 1.6;\\\">El ser humano se encuentra separado de Dios por el pecado, pero recibe el perd\\u00f3n y la vida eterna solo por gracia, mediante la fe en Jesucristo.<\\/p>\",\"paragraph_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":5,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=000b116\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"7718283\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"20\",\"row\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"20\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_border\":\"none\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_color\":\"#E7E0D8\",\"animation\":\"fadeInUp\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fbad85d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"5\",\"row\":\"5\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"5\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c0563bd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"La Iglesia y la esperanza eterna\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"left\",\"title_color\":\"#282320\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=e8d16ad\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"db13c7d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p style=\\\"font-size: 17.5px; color: #756C66; line-height: 1.6;\\\">Creemos que todos los que conf\\u00edan en Cristo forman parte de su cuerpo, unidos en Su familia como hijos. Somos llamados a adorar, discipular, servir y esperamos con certeza la resurrecci\\u00f3n final para vida eterna con Dios.<\\/p>\",\"paragraph_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":5,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=000b116\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true,\"isLocked\":true},{\"id\":\"0291db3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"Pesta\\u00f1a #2\",\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c7a7c0e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width